#ASSERT `By when may I apply to the Tribunal for work` (`the calendar date` 2 4 2027) TRUE (`the calendar date` 20 4 2027) TRUE (`the calendar date` 1 10 2026) EQUALS `the worker cannot apply to the Tribunal under s 18(4d): s 18(4e)`
