-- injured worker's cost on 1 March 2030 is; travel to a permanent impairment assessment on 1 March 2029 is (reg 23(2b)).
#ASSERT `Is my medical cost still covered` FALSE (`the calendar date` 2 3 2026) TRUE (`the calendar date` 28 2 2028) `an ordinary medical cost` (`the calendar date` 28 2 2029)
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my medical cost still covered` FALSE (`the calendar date` 2 3 2026) TRUE (`the calendar date` 28 2 2028) `an ordinary medical cost` (`the calendar date` 1 3 2029))
#ASSERT `Is my medical cost still covered` TRUE (`the calendar date` 2 3 2026) TRUE (`the calendar date` 28 2 2028) `an ordinary medical cost` (`the calendar date` 1 3 2030)
#ASSERT `Is my medical cost still covered` FALSE (`the calendar date` 2 3 2026) TRUE (`the calendar date` 28 2 2028) `travel and accommodation to attend a permanent impairment assessment` (`the calendar date` 1 3 2029)
