#ASSERT `How much notice must I get before my payments change` `a reduced incapacity, on a health practitioner's certificate, without the worker's consent` (`the calendar date` 3 3 2026) (`the calendar date` 1 6 2026) EQUALS `notice must be given at least this many days before the decision takes effect` 14
#ASSERT `How much notice must I get before my payments change` `a review under s 46` (`the calendar date` 3 3 2026) (`the calendar date` 1 4 2027) EQUALS `notice must be given at least this many days before the decision takes effect` 28
#ASSERT `How much notice must I get before my payments change` `another ground, such as the worker's consent, a return to work or the passage of time` (`the calendar date` 3 3 2026) (`the calendar date` 1 6 2026) EQUALS `notice must be given as soon as practicable after the decision, not necessarily before it takes effect`
#ASSERT `By when must I apply to keep my payments going` (`the calendar date` 10 6 2026) EQUALS `the calendar date` 10 7 2026
